condensed|Shortened information sense fits source evidence, with meeting account rather than a dairy product. Vietnamese cô đọng retains essential meaning; participial adjective has no invented tense restriction.
fashion|Popular clothing style and manner are separated by Oxford ordinals. Wide trousers example and unusual photo arrangement each match their own sense; Vietnamese mốt versus cách is deliberate.
long-time|Attributive role duration checked with a neighbour example. Gloss is standalone lâu năm, not an unfinished time phrase; the example does not imply all long-standing relationships are close.
prepare|Room preparation is a transitive make-ready event. Vietnamese preserves volunteers and evening class; notes distinguish prepare for and prepare to without narrowing to one example's tense.
suffer|Experiencing distress and impersonal deterioration are meaning distinctions, not separate time forms. Noise from construction and garden harm both translate faithfully without assuming a medical diagnosis.
